  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Links 2 to 5 individuals for one day. Their health pools merge, gaining a bonus of {{math spellPower \"*\" 5}} health. If the shared health drops to zero, each member suffers a serious injury, and the spell ends. The last affected target falls to 0 health (incapacitated and dying), while others remain conscious with 10 health each. The spell cannot be dismissed early. When it expires, remaining health is split evenly.</p>",
